{"id":"mutillidae-ii--xss--xss-dom-based","path":"mutillidae-ii/xss/xss-dom-based.md","title":"XSS DOM-Based","category":"mutillidae-ii","source":"https://github.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/blob/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/mutillidae-ii/xss/xss-dom-based.md","html":"<h1 id=\"xss-dom-based\">XSS DOM-Based</h1>\n<h2 id=\"xss-dom-based-2\">XSS - DOM-Based</h2>\n<p>Go to login page form <a href=\"https://127.0.0.1/index.php?page=login.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://127.0.0.1/index.php?page=login.php</a></p>\n<p>and log in using login bypass or inserting password.</p>\n<p>Go to a page vulnerable to XSS stored like as: <a href=\"https://127.0.0.1/index.php?page=add-to-your-blog.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://127.0.0.1/index.php?page=add-to-your-blog.php</a></p>\n<figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand XSS DOM-Based screenshot\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(41)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1).png\" alt=\"XSS DOM-Based screenshot\"></button><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n\n<p>in this two field will inject our payload:</p>\n<div class=\"walkthrough-command\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-command\">Copy command</button><pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">element.innerHTML='... &lt;img src=1 onerror=alert(document.cookie)&gt; ...'\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>the image 1 does not exist, so the alert will be triggered, the command will be injected into DOM and execute on the page: </p>\n<figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand XSS DOM-Based screenshot\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(38)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1).png\" alt=\"XSS DOM-Based screenshot\"></button><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n\n<figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand XSS DOM-Based screenshot\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(40)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1).png\" alt=\"XSS DOM-Based screenshot\"></button><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n\n<figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand XSS DOM-Based screenshot\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(39)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1)%20(1).png\" alt=\"XSS DOM-Based screenshot\"></button><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n","toc":[{"id":"xss-dom-based-2","title":"XSS - DOM-Based","level":2}],"excerpt":"XSS DOM-Based XSS - DOM-Based Go to login page form https://127.0.0.1/index.php?page=login.php and log in using login bypass or inserting password. Go to a page vulnerable to XSS stored like as: https://127.0.0.1/index.p","searchText":"XSS - DOM-Based"}